OL,3,AUkraine pushes Russia back on front
OL,4,Aline where Starlink has played key role
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Russian drone zips across the
OL,7,Fcomputer screen, startling the
OL,8,Fcommanders keeping watch over the
OL,9,Fbattlefield via a live stream in their
OL,10,Fbunker.
OL,12,FCigarette in one hand, radio in the
OL,13,Fother, one of them calls in their own
OL,14,Fdrone to bring it down and warns the
OL,15,Fsoldiers below of the threat. The men
OL,16,Fare dangerously exposed, on the long
OL,17,Fwalk across open ground from their
OL,18,Ffront line positions. They are being
OL,19,Freplaced after three months forcing the
OL,20,FRussians back.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
