OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUkraine pushes Russia back on front
OL,4,Aline where Starlink has played key role
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis is part of Operation Vivaldi, a
OL,7,FUkrainian counter-offensive which they
OL,8,Fsay has liberated 277 sq km (106 square
OL,9,Fmiles) in the eastern Donbas region in
OL,10,Frecent months.
OL,12,FThe name reflects the offensive's four
OL,13,Fstages, or seasons - like the Italian
OL,14,Fcomposer's violin concerto. The
OL,15,Fsuccessful assault blunted an attempted
OL,16,FRussian pincer movement that threatened
OL,17,Fto encircle the key Fortress Belt
OL,18,Fcities still under Ukrainian control.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
